        "date": "2026-11-12T00:29:17Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(xtask): Gate maps name the crate a moved module lives in\n\n134 app suites named modules that M4.1 moved out of app as app::<module>,\nso quick never selected them for a change in post, sim or motion (a\npost/mod.rs change picked 3 of 33 post suites). Rewrite the headers to\n<crate>::<module>, give heidenhain_cycles a map, and pin the selection\nwith xtask tests that read the real headers.\n\nBumps PROCESS_VERSION to 17 (xtask changed).\n\nFixes #922\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
