      "message": "test: move 12 misplaced test files into the crates that own them\n\nEight heidenhain/probe/comment/lathe/doosan post tests go to\ncamcraft-post, boundary_walls and real_tip to camcraft-sim, arcs to\ncamcraft-motion, origin_approach to camcraft-cl. Imports switch from\ncamcraft_app/camcraft_motion to the owner crate, Gate maps name the\nreal crate, and the xtask pins follow the move (plus a new pin that\nthe files live in their owner crate). #[test] counts are unchanged.\n\nFixes #921\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
