      "message": "fix(xtask): quick maps a #[path]-included file to its parent's submodule\n\ncrates/app/src/posting_index_swing.rs is app::posting::index_swing (posting.rs\nincludes it by #[path]), but quick read it as a top-level module no Gate map\nnames, so a change to the index-swing law selected none of its suites.\npath_mods::included_as resolves the includer; pinned by\ngate_maps_tests::a_path_included_file_selects_its_parents_submodule_suites.\nPROCESS_VERSION 20 (xtask is a process file).\n\nFixes #1021\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
