      },
      "message": "fix(xtask): map a #[path] file to both its own name and its parent's submodule (#1033 review)\n\nA union, so resolving the includer only ever adds suites: posting_sim keeps\nwall_column_gouge and contour_arc_sim, posting_suppressed keeps\nrest_across_setups, posting_plasma keeps plasma_gate (pinned), and *_tests.rs\nincludes no longer narrow. #[path] in // comments is ignored.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
